  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.45 Senate Plate",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.45 Senate Plate.\n\n(a) Senate plates shall be issued to members of the New Hampshire senate pursuant to RSA 261:90.\n\n(b) In addition to the requirements set forth in RSA 261:90, senate plates shall:\n\n(1) Have the word \"SENATE\";\n\n(2) Have the years of term;\n\n(3) Have a numeral from one to 24 corresponding to the number of the senatorial district; and\n\n(4) Have the state seal.\n\n(c) At the request of the senate president, the director shall issue special number plates with title designations.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 514.43); renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.44); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.44)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
